{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今晚隆重舉行，當中壓軸大抽獎環節成為全晚焦點。憑《中年好聲音》入行兼現年46歲顏志恆擊敗其餘四位對手，成功奪得高達45萬免找數簽賬額大獎。這位幸運兒在鏡頭外不為人知隱藏職業與背景亦隨之全面曝光。</p>\n<h2>汪明荃抽出五位幸運兒 顏志恆猜中數字奪冠</h2>\n<p>今晚台慶壓軸環節由汪明荃負責抽出五位藝人參與終極大獎爭奪戰。顏志恆與陳旭培以及袁絲珩文佐匡黃星綽齊齊被選中上台大玩開口中遊戲。經過一輪緊張刺激比拚後，顏志恆最終成功估中83號幸運數字脫穎而出，順利帶走總值45萬免找數簽賬額。至於其他四位落敗入圍者亦沒有空手而回，各人分別贏得總值超過1萬豐富獎品。</p>\n<h2>司儀麥美恩上前擁抱祝賀顏志恆難掩激動心情</h2>\n<p>當大會宣布賽果一刻現場氣氛推至最高峰。身穿深色服裝出席慶典顏志恆接過巨型支票時難掩心中喜悅，司儀麥美恩見狀立即衝上前送上熱情擁抱為他祝賀一番。一眾同場電視台藝員亦紛紛上前包圍這位大贏家，齊齊為他送上熱烈掌聲與歡呼聲，場面非常熱鬧。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950999016731375_5331670986aff0cfe17bd4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6339315817471743423.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950999016731375_5331670986aff0cfe17bd4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509990301861958_19521857266aff0cffa921a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6339315817471743424.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509990301861958_19521857266aff0cffa921a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950999049405392_14082386456aff0d019f1f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6339315817471743425.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950999049405392_14082386456aff0d019f1f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>《中年好聲音》素人歌手兼任五星酒店西餐廚師</h2>\n<p>現年46歲顏志恆於2022年報名參加歌唱比賽節目《中年好聲音》第一季，當初在太太極力鼓勵下決定追夢。他在比賽中憑扎實唱功獲得第五名，因經常在浴室練習而被大眾封為「浴室歌王」，並於2023年正式簽約成為旗下藝人。除了擁有藝人身分外，他入行至今超過二十年正職其實是一名五星級酒店西餐廚師，早前更獲酒店頒發長期服務獎，一直繼續兼顧雙重身分。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509990719069005_10830350636aff0d039a85f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"nchbenson_1682226027_3087058127065892925_12780091.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509990719069005_10830350636aff0d039a85f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@nchbenson）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509990917743456_8035004316aff0d05c2f44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"nchbenson_1685871694_3117640198200799021_12780091.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509990917743456_8035004316aff0d05c2f44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@nchbenson）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509991209056743_15028754566aff0d087ff85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"nchbenson_1713074165_3345831062177013240_12780091.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509991209056743_15028754566aff0d087ff85.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@nchbenson）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509991433512634_20257393926aff0d0aa4de2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"nchbenson_1733587591_3517910151824515179_12780091.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509991433512634_20257393926aff0d0aa4de2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@nchbenson）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>《中年好聲音》總決賽嘉賓評判有三位巨星駕臨？<i></i></p>\n<p>《中年好聲音》總決賽即將於4月23晚進行直播，不但主持陣容加馬，評審陣容方面，除了有四位固定評審外，還邀請到三位重量級樂壇前輩駕臨電視城⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B9%B4%E5%A5%BD%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3-11%E5%BC%B7-%E8%B5%B7%E5%BA%95-%E6%87%B6%E4%BA%BA%E5%8C%85-pltc08-1482594/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E4%B8%AD%E5%B9%B4%E5%A5%BD%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">按此10強參賽者背景懶人包</a></b></p>\n<p>《中年好聲音夢想成真演唱會》售票優惠？<i></i></p>\n<p>無綫宣布將會為優勝選手舉行《中年好聲音 夢想成真演唱會》，售票詳情及優惠請即看：<b><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B9%B4%E5%A5%BD%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E5%90%B3%E5%A4%A7%E5%BC%B7-%E6%9E%97%E9%89%AB%E5%BE%AB-10%E5%BC%B7-plt-1145053/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E4%B8%AD%E5%B9%B4%E5%A5%BD%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會售票詳情</a></b></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:58:56.381232+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":903,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:51:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:55.286884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:52:22.089931+00:00","content_hash":"a557aa322dd4a48132a8adeb5685dc3a7a1643e1a2e6866e313f82ad15335f13","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}